      "statement": "An update run can short-circuit as a no-op only after Claims preflight passes with zero issues and no repository changes are detected since the last update: the lifecycle finalizes Claims, refreshes .last-update.json as complete, and the runner returns skipped:true with a noop progress event and telemetry outcome without running any agent. getUpdateNoopStatus refuses to skip when the previous update was interrupted or the requested language changed.",
